---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---
<Layout title="Dairy Queen Deals & Combos 2026 — $7 Meal Deal, 2-for-$5 & More" description="Every current Dairy Queen deal and combo for 2026 — the $7 Meal Deal, 2-for-$5 Mix & Match, and combo pricing. Independently compiled value guide with estimated prices.">

<nav aria-label="Breadcrumb" class="breadcrumb"><div class="container"><ol><li><a href="/">Home</a></li><li aria-current="page">Deals &amp; Combos</li></ol></div></nav>

  
<!-- AdX: before content -->
<div id="div-gpt-ad-thedairyqueenmenu_us-before_content">
  <script>
    googletag.cmd.push(function() { googletag.display('div-gpt-ad-thedairyqueenmenu_us-before_content'); });
  </script>
</div>

<section class="section">
  <div class="container article-body" style="max-width:960px;">
    <h1 style="font-family:var(--font-display);font-size:clamp(2.2rem,5vw,3.4rem);color:var(--color-primary);margin-bottom:.3em;">Dairy Queen Deals &amp; Combos 2026</h1>
    <p style="font-size:1.05rem;color:var(--color-text-muted);max-width:720px;">DQ's best-value orders in one place — the headline meal deals, the Mix &amp; Match, and how to combo your order for less. Prices below are independently compiled 2026 estimates; participating locations set their own pricing, so confirm at your local DQ.</p>
<!-- AdX: after paragraph 1 -->
<div id="div-gpt-ad-thedairyqueenmenu_us-paragraph">
  <script>
    googletag.cmd.push(function() { googletag.display('div-gpt-ad-thedairyqueenmenu_us-paragraph'); });
  </script>
</div>


    <h2 class="section-title" style="margin-top:2em;">Headline Deals</h2>
    <div class="table-wrap"><table class="size-table"><thead><tr><th>Deal</th><th>Price</th><th>What You Get</th></tr></thead><tbody>
      <tr><td><strong><a href="/items/7-meal-deal">$7 Meal Deal</a></strong></td><td class="price-cell">$7.00</td><td>Cheeseburger or 3-Pc Chicken Strip Basket + Fries + Soft Drink + Small Sundae</td></tr>
      <tr><td><strong><a href="/items/2-for-5-mix-match">2-for-$5 Mix &amp; Match</a></strong></td><td class="price-cell">$5.00</td><td>Any two eligible items — fries, 2-pc strips, chili dog, cheeseburger, small sundae, or drink</td></tr>
    </tbody></table></div>

    <h2 class="section-title" style="margin-top:1.5em;">Build-Your-Own Combo Value</h2>
    <p>If a set deal is not available at your location, you can still combo any entrée with fries and a drink. Because a <a href="/items/soft-drinks">Soft Drink</a> ($2.11+) and <a href="/items/regular-fries">Regular Fries</a> ($2.49) add up quickly, bundling through a deal almost always beats ordering the three items separately.</p>
    <div class="table-wrap"><table class="size-table"><thead><tr><th>If You Want…</th><th>Best Value Move</th></tr></thead><tbody>
      <tr><td>A full cheap meal</td><td>The <a href="/items/7-meal-deal">$7 Meal Deal</a> — entrée, side, drink, and dessert together</td></tr>
      <tr><td>Snacks to share</td><td><a href="/items/2-for-5-mix-match">2-for-$5</a> — two small items for $5</td></tr>
      <tr><td>Just dessert value</td><td>A <a href="/items/dilly-bar">Dilly Bar</a> ($1.99) or Mini <a href="/items/oreo-blizzard">Blizzard</a> ($3.49)</td></tr>
      <tr><td>A birthday</td><td>A <a href="/categories/dq-cakes">DQ Cake</a> from $22.99, ordered 48 hours ahead</td></tr>
    </tbody></table></div>

    <h2 class="section-title" style="margin-top:1.5em;">Popular Deal Items</h2>
    <p>Browse the items most often ordered as part of a DQ deal:
      <a href="/items/2-for-5-mix-match">2-for-$5 Mix &amp; Match</a>,
      <a href="/items/7-meal-deal">$7 Meal Deal</a>,
      <a href="/items/2pc-chicken-strips">2-Piece Chicken Strips</a>,
      <a href="/items/original-cheeseburger">Original Cheeseburger</a>,
      <a href="/items/regular-fries">Regular Fries</a>, and
      <a href="/items/soft-drinks">Soft Drinks</a>.</p>

    <h2 class="section-title" style="margin-top:1.5em;">Frequently Asked Questions</h2>
    <div class="faq-list">
      <div class="faq-item"><button class="faq-q" aria-expanded="false">What is on the DQ $7 Meal Deal?<span class="faq-icon">+</span></button><div class="faq-a"><div class="faq-a-inner">Your choice of a Cheeseburger or 3-Piece Chicken Strip Basket, plus Regular Fries, a Soft Drink, and a Small Sundae for $7.00 at participating DQ Grill &amp; Chill locations.</div></div></div>
      <div class="faq-item"><button class="faq-q" aria-expanded="false">What is the 2-for-$5 Mix &amp; Match?<span class="faq-icon">+</span></button><div class="faq-a"><div class="faq-a-inner">Pick any two eligible items — such as fries, 2-piece chicken strips, a chili dog, an original cheeseburger, or a small sundae — for $5.00 total.</div></div></div>
      <div class="faq-item"><button class="faq-q" aria-expanded="false">Are these deals available everywhere?<span class="faq-icon">+</span></button><div class="faq-a"><div class="faq-a-inner">No. Deals and pricing are set by individual franchisees and offered at participating locations only, so both availability and price vary by store. Always confirm with your local DQ.</div></div></div>
    </div>

    <p style="margin-top:32px;padding-top:18px;border-top:1px solid var(--color-border);font-size:.9rem;color:var(--color-text-muted);">Deal contents and prices are independently compiled 2026 estimates and change frequently. For the full menu, visit <a href="/"><strong>The Dairy Queen Menu</strong></a>. This site is not affiliated with Dairy Queen®.</p>
  </div>
</section>

</Layout>
